  "post_content": "<p>Este s&aacute;bado 3 de agosto la pista exterior del pabell&oacute;n municipal de Onda ha acogido un festival musical, organizado por la Asociaci&oacute;n Rellamp, con Lady&rsquo;s Garden, Rumbolog&iacute;a y Herbasana Rock, dentro de <a href=\"http://onda.es/la-ciudad/eventos/festividad-del-salvador\" target=\"_blank\">las fiestas del Salvador</a>.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/08/IMG_0750.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Ha sido estilos distintos, pero Lady&#39;s Garden y Rumbolog&iacute;a tienen en com&uacute;n al bajista ondense Javi Castillo. Mientras tanto, contin&uacute;a <a href=\"http://onda.es/la-ciudad/eventos/fira-medieval-2013\" target=\"_blank\">en el centro hist&oacute;rico y el castillo la Feria Medieval</a>.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertrellampelsalvador13/img_0735.jpg\" alt=\"img_0735\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertrellampelsalvador13/img_0736.jpg\" alt=\"img_0736\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertrellampelsalvador13/img_0738.jpg\" alt=\"img_0738\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertrellampelsalvador13/img_0739.jpg\" alt=\"img_0739\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertrellampelsalvador13/img_0740.jpg\" alt=\"img_0740\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertrellampelsalvador13/img_0741.jpg\" alt=\"img_0741\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertrellampelsalvador13/img_0742.jpg\" a